{"id":"u-2f19e621-c936-4593-9c89-0794561b9f7c","src":"community","title":"Brute Force","author":"Coach B","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/brute-force-11","desc":"Breaks plateaus through brute force on the main lifts (Squat, Bench, Deadlift, Overhead Press). To start pick the heavy weight your stuck at and do that for the first 3 sets, then drop the weight for the higher rep range sets. When you can hit 6 reps for the heavy sets add 10 pounds for the Squat and Dead and 5 for the presses. Feel free to switch up the accessory movements but preform them the same way and you might want to switch them on weeks 7-12. I also mean tricep dips. The Rpe’s are a little wonky because this is a lot of bro science. It did in crease my bench by 40lbs so that’s cool. Have a rest day between days 2 and 3 and have 2 rest days between days 4 and 1.","level":["Intermediate"],"goals":["Strength","Muscle"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":90,"joins":21,"rate":5,"rateCount":1,"updated":"2026-03-15T02:19:23.550Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Day 1","Day 2","Day 3","Day 4","Day 5","Day 6","Day 7","Day 8"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":2,"hi":6,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":9.5,"x":3},{"lo":6,"hi":12,"rpe":6,"rpeHi":8,"x":2}]},{"n":"Overhead Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":12,"rpe":6,"rpeHi":10,"x":3},{"lo":10,"hi":15,"rpe":6,"rpeHi":10}]},{"n":"Incline Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":6,"rpeHi":10,"x":2}]},{"n":"Dip (Bodyweight)","sets":[{"amrap":1,"rpe":6,"rpeHi":10,"x":2}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Squat (Low Bar)","sets":[{"lo":3,"hi":6,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":9.5},{"lo":2,"hi":6,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":9.5,"x":2},{"lo":6,"hi":12,"rpe":6,"rpeHi":9.5,"x":3}]},{"n":"Leg Press (45 Degrees)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":6,"rpeHi":10,"x":3}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Deadlift (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":3,"hi":6,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":9.5,"x":3}]},{"n":"Romanian Deadlift (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":12,"rpe":6,"rpeHi":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Bent Over Row (Barbell)","sets":[{"l